    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "writing or art or whatever doesnt stop the cycle from happening again. every time i think i've turned a corner, i just crash. it feels like i'm just prolonging the inevitable. if nothing ever actually changes, then what's the point of all this constant struggle? it feels like i'm just waiting for the floor to fall out from under me anyway.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
